{
 "_comment": "Registry of bounded worker task types for the MySugya worker pipeline (scripts/worker_pipeline.py). Each type declares its scope contract; manifests are generated from these definitions and enforced by the scope validator and CI. Sonnet is the only execution and escalation model: every type carries model 'sonnet' and escalationModel 'sonnet'. Capability tiers are expressed by mechanicalTier (contract is fully pattern-checkable) and independentReviewRequired (a second, independent Sonnet review must approve the PR before merge), never by model name. lifecycle declares how a pass ends: 'pr' types produce a tracked change and therefore take a VERSION bump plus one PR; 'read-only' types must leave the tracked tree byte-identical and never bump VERSION or open a PR. Editing this file is a pipeline change: Sonnet only, docs-tooling PR.",
